# ==============================================================================
# CRITICAL OAUTH STEP FOR VERCEL DEPLOYMENTS:
# ==============================================================================
# If Google Sign-In fails on Vercel with "auth/unauthorized-domain":
# 1. Open Firebase Console: https://console.firebase.google.com/project/mystic-sled-9zbz0/authentication/settings
# 2. Go to "Authentication" -> "Settings" -> "Authorized Domains".
# 3. Click "Add domain" and enter your Vercel domain (e.g. your-app.vercel.app).
# 4. In Google Cloud Console -> Credentials -> OAuth 2.0 Client IDs, add:
#    - Authorized JavaScript origins: https://your-app.vercel.app
# ==============================================================================
